cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the curated dataset, please cite both the paper and this repository."
title: "Reframing Genetic Medicine in Terms of Impact"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible research project evaluating genetic medicine in terms of present and
  prospective impact. The analysis combines a structured disease-by-intervention catalogue,
  global disease-burden estimates, intervention and access modeling, a reproductive analysis
  of cases in which no unaffected embryo can be selected, and an exploratory model of how
  polygenic editing could alter common-disease risk as technological capacity increases. The
  project distinguishes present impact from the translational germline-editing frontier and
  future polygenic impact, and separates quantitative results from ethical and regulatory
  interpretation.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/alethicresearch/genmed-impact"
url: "https://github.com/alethicresearch/genmed-impact"
version: "0.1.0"
